# Harmonious Grovestrider, a */*: its power and toughness come from a characteristic-defining ability (CR 604.3). Bot1 has a Forest (so it is a 1/1) and enchants it with Enchanted River's
# Grasp, "Enchanted creature loses all abilities": with the ability gone its power and toughness are 0 (the * has nothing to stand for), a 0/0 that state-based actions put into the
# graveyard (CR 704.5f), and the Aura with it (CR 704.5m). Ward {2} is lost too, but Bot1 is its controller, so the Aura is not countered.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Harmonious Grovestrider
Forest
Enchanted River's Grasp
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Harmonious Grovestrider.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Harmonious Grovestrider.Power = 1
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enchanted River's Grasp.Cast(Harmonious Grovestrider)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Harmonious Grovestrider = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Enchanted River's Grasp = (absent)
